<title>USA: Commerzbank names N.Y. capital markets executives.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank names N.Y. capital markets executives.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerzbank AG said it named Warren Carter and Udo Braun as managing directors of Commerzbank Capital Markets Corp (CCMC).</p>
<p>Carter joined CCMC in June 1996 after having worked with Credit Suisse First Boston, Aubrey G. Lanston &amp; Co and the U.S. Treasury, the bank said.</p>
<p>Braun was formerly with Commerzbank in Frankfurt, it said.</p>
<p>Braun and Carter succeed Karl Oellinger, who retired Dec 31, Commerzbank said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660))</p>
